; sweep-novice.eval — the same rung twelve times, twelve different seeds.
;
; Combat is dice. One encounter is an anecdote: a 5% fumble or a 6% critical
; cannot show up honestly in a single fight, and tuning against one is tuning
; against one lucky afternoon. The artefact here is the TABLE of TALLY lines —
; grep them out and compare distributions across a knob change.

logecho on
newgame
timescale 0
lockstep on

sweep 12 rungs/novice-1skeleton.eval

state
